**📋 My Evaluation Stack & Testing Methodology**

I do not rely blindly on automated scanners. My rigorous manual testing matrix ensures comprehensive barrier identification:

- **Automated Baselines:** Axe-core CLI, Accessibility Insights for Web, and WAVE.
- **Screen Reader Testing:** **NVDA** on Windows 11 (Chrome/Edge), **VoiceOver** on iOS (Safari).
- **Manual Inspection:** Full keyboard-only pathing, visible focus state checking, 400% browser zoom reflow validation, and high-contrast color contrast analysis via TPGi CCA.

